# The urlopen example, scripted:
#   cargo run --example urlopen --features script -- --morph-script examples/scripts/urlopen.morph
# Grey until a link arrives, then a hue from its scheme and host. The tap
# at the end would open https://example.com/; scripted, it is only logged.
frames 1
screenshot waiting
open libmorph-urlopen://a/b#secret
frames 1
screenshot opened
open libmorph-urlopen://other-host/x?k=v
frames 1
screenshot other
tap 540 1170
